Package: orcheroute
Version: 0.8.5
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ivan Kiselev <kiselev.ivan1111@gmail.com>
Depends: ca-certificates, iproute2, systemd, nftables, iptables, curl, tar, gzip, dpkg, apt, systemd-timesyncd | chrony | ntpsec | ntp
Description: cross-platform traffic orchestration and VPN control plane
 OrcheRoute combines a Go control plane, Mihomo transport, policy routing,
 subscription management and a responsive local/server user interface.
